      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Your first real sidearm. The 9mm Pistol is semi-automatic and fed from an eighteen-round magazine, so a reload is one key press instead of the Hand Cannon\u0027s slow single shot.\n\nIt is an LV Assembler recipe. The inputs are a Hardened Steel Barrel, Mechanical Parts T2, steel plates, rubber plates, steel screws and a spring: the parts from the last quest plus a little rubber, standing in for a plastic grip. NEI has the exact list.\n\nThe pistol takes 9mm Pistol Magazines, filled from three bullets each; see the Magazines quest next.\n\n[note]Press Reload with a loaded magazine in your inventory. Sneak and right-click a magazine to empty it back into loose rounds.[/note]",
